OL,3,GNEWSACrews return to fire at recycling
OL,4,Acentre
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews have returned to a fire at a
OL,7,Frecycling centre in Derbyshire after
OL,8,Fstaff reported seeing flames.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fit was called at 19:54 BST on Saturday
OL,12,Fto a fire off Staveley Lane, Eckington,
OL,13,Fand after a "challenging night"
OL,14,Fremained on site damping down until
OL,15,Flate on Sunday morning.
OL,17,FA reinspection had been scheduled for
OL,18,FMonday, but on-site monitoring teams
OL,19,Freported seeing flames.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
